**This is money arithmetic on a reconciliation.** The rental reconciler is the independent second computation of a quote's monthly revenue, cost, gross profit and contract value. If it counts a total line's pages wrongly it flags a correct quote (a false FAIL: at quantity 2 revenue 1268.58 against 884.29) or, worse, agrees with a wrong calculator (a false PASS). Your verdict states in plain words what a wrong answer shows a user, with your own numbers (Step 7). The product owner's 2026-11-03 ruling for this lane, verbatim: "Build it, strict review (tier 1, as MPSCALC-361)". **A price, total, status, hash, id or issue-order change on any existing case, or any per-device or unset rental reconciled figure that is not byte-equal to main, is a Blocker.**
